    "sections": {
        "description": "Elmira is a free, multipurpose WordPress theme engineered for large enterprises and ambitious businesses demanding outstanding functionality and pixel-perfect design. Its signature dark, proficient layout and refined color scheme immediately establish a sense of professionalism and authority. It is perfectly suited for: Business, Corporate, Finance, Agency, Consulting, SaaS, Education, Construction, eCommerce (WooCommerce), Health &amp; Medical, Law, Architecture, industries, Blog/Magazine, Fashion, Online Shop, Travel, and more. It has some exotic features like clean code, advanced typography, sticky menu, logo upload, header image, Bootstrap 4 framework, built with SEO in mind, mobile-ready, translation-ready (WPML, Polylang), and built to be beautiful on all screen sizes. This theme supports the best Elementor page builder to create, edit, and update page designs as per the requirement. Elmira also supports popular free and premium WordPress plugins, including Elementor, Yoast SEO, WooCommerce, Contact Form 7, Jetpack, Google Analytics, and more. Check the demo of ArileWP Pro https://themearile.com/arilewp-pro-theme/."
    },
